# Coding subagent lock (D-035)

When this repo is developed with a main Cloud Agent plus subagents:

- **Main agent (Grok 4.6 High, not fast):** writes Markdown/docs and reviews. Design contracts stay here.
- **Composer 2.5:** default coding subagent.

When launching a `Task` for implementation, coding, tests, or mechanical code edits, set `model` to `composer-2.5`.

Do **not** omit `model` on coding tasks (omission inherits Grok). Do **not** use `composer-2.5-fast` unless the owner asked for speed. Do not make Composer the primary author of VISION, DECISIONS, ARCHITECTURE, HANDOFF, UI sitemap, GAME_STATES, DATA_MODEL, ADRs, or similar governance docs.

Composer may write Markdown that is part of the coding work (HANDOFF note, KNOWN DIFFERENCE, test note). The main agent still reviews it before it is a project contract.

When the coding gate is green, the session still **merges into `main`** (D-045). Do not leave finished Composer work on an open PR. Watch Race UI expansion stays deferred (D-043).
